<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Lend Lease, Sinar Mas in property deal.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Lend Lease, Sinar Mas in property deal.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lend Lease Corp said on Tuesday it had reached a joint venture agreement with the Sinar Mas conglomerate for the construction of a commercial and retail complex in Indonesia which would be valued at A$200 million on completion.</p>
</text>
